		COMMENT Sets the {@link #unsaved} flag for this Chunk
	METHOD packTicks (Lnet/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel;)V
		COMMENT Remove scheduled ticks belonging to this chunk from the world and keep it locally for incoming serialization
		ARG 1 level
	METHOD promotePendingBlockEntity (Lnet/minecraft/core/BlockPos;Lnet/minecraft/nbt/CompoundTag;)Lnet/minecraft/world/level/block/entity/BlockEntity;
		COMMENT Sets up or deserializes a {@link BlockEntity} at the desired location from the given compound. If the compound's BlockEntity id is {@code "DUMMY"}, the BlockEntity may be created by the {@link EntityBlock} instance if the {@link Block} at the given position can be represented as such. Otherwise, the BlockEntity is deserialized at the given position.
		ARG 1 pos
		ARG 2 tag
